<section class="section">
  <h1 class="t-section">About</h1>

  <div class="about-intro">
    <p class="about-intro__tagline"><%= club.tagline %></p>
    <div class="about-intro__desc">
      <p>This is a group for fantasy/sci-fi book lovers and newbies!</p>
      <p>
        Each month we'll meet on the last Wednesday to discuss a book of the group's choosing.
      </p>
      <p>
        For the book selection, we'll vote in person three months ahead.
        So during our July meetup, we'll vote for our October read.
        In August we'll vote for November and so on.
        So come join our meetups if you want to have a say in what we read!
      </p>
      <p>
        You don't need to have finished the book to come join us!
        Even if you're just part way through, feel free to join us for some conversation and drinks/food.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-stats">
    <div class="about-stats__item">
      <div class="about-stats__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="about-stats__value"><%= totalBooks %></span>
      <span class="about-stats__label">Books Read</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-stats__item">
      <div class="about-stats__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 0 0 2.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 0 0 4.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 0 0-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128H5.228A2 2 0 0 1 3.213 17.1 9.6 9.6 0 0 1 3 15.75c0-3.728 2.134-6.959 5.25-8.528A9.8 9.8 0 0 1 12 6.75c1.357 0 2.648.281 3.82.793"/>
          <path d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="about-stats__value"><%= totalMembers %></span>
      <span class="about-stats__label">Members</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-stats__item">
      <div class="about-stats__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M11.48 3.499a.562.562 0 0 1 1.04 0l2.125 5.111a.563.563 0 0 0 .475.345l5.518.442c.499.04.701.663.321.988l-4.204 3.602a.563.563 0 0 0-.182.557l1.285 5.385a.562.562 0 0 1-.84.61l-4.725-2.885a.562.562 0 0 0-.586 0L6.982 20.54a.562.562 0 0 1-.84-.61l1.285-5.386a.562.562 0 0 0-.182-.557l-4.204-3.602a.562.562 0 0 1 .321-.988l5.518-.442a.563.563 0 0 0 .475-.345L11.48 3.5Z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="about-stats__value"><%= totalReviews %></span>
      <span class="about-stats__label">Reviews</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h2 class="t-section-sm">How It Works</h2>
    <ol class="about-steps">
      <li class="about-steps__item">
        <strong>Nominate</strong> &mdash; Members suggest books for the upcoming month.
      </li>
      <li class="about-steps__item">
        <strong>Vote</strong> &mdash; Everyone votes on their favorites and we pick a winner.
      </li>
      <li class="about-steps__item">
        <strong>Read</strong> &mdash; We all read the winning book at our own pace.
      </li>
      <li class="about-steps__item">
        <strong>Discuss</strong> &mdash; We meet up to share thoughts, reviews, and grades.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section about-ctas">
    <h2 class="t-section-sm">Join Us</h2>
    <p class="about-section__text">
      Ready to dive in? Create an account to nominate, vote, and review books with the club.
    </p>
    <div class="about-ctas__buttons">
      <a href="/login" class="btn btn--primary">
